And Michael says, we should have our own party.

1570
01:02:35.290 --> 01:02:36.730
Let's all go play mini golf.

1571
01:02:36.730 --> 01:02:40.490
Both Ronnie and Michael and Dwight and Holly.

1572
01:02:40.710 --> 01:02:41.470
That foursome.

1573
01:02:41.810 --> 01:02:43.110
Oh, I wish that happened.

1574
01:02:43.210 --> 01:02:43.790
Me, too.

1575
01:02:44.330 --> 01:02:46.750
Well, Holly can't go because she has a date tonight.

1576
01:02:47.490 --> 01:02:47.670
Mm.

1577
01:02:47.930 --> 01:02:50.190
And then Michael has the sweetest talking head.

1578
01:02:50.390 --> 01:02:51.910
He's like, Holly doesn't need any luck.

1579
01:02:52.230 --> 01:02:54.690
Everyone who meets her instantly loves her.

1580
01:02:55.570 --> 01:02:55.810
Yeah.

1581
01:02:56.070 --> 01:02:56.830
So cute.

1582
01:02:56.850 --> 01:02:58.690
I want these two kids to get together.

1583
01:02:59.250 --> 01:03:03.530
Angela, I have a question for you about the next scene, which is when Dwight busts in

1584
01:03:03.530 --> 01:03:04.970
and he kicks over the cake.

1585
01:03:04.970 --> 01:03:05.390
Yeah.

1586
01:03:05.730 --> 01:03:06.690
I wasn't there.

1587
01:03:06.870 --> 01:03:07.590
I'm at art school.

1588
01:03:07.890 --> 01:03:09.230
What was it like to shoot that scene?

1589
01:03:09.390 --> 01:03:10.030
Here's the thing.

1590
01:03:10.370 --> 01:03:15.330
That room was like, I mean, Jenna, it was like six feet by six feet.

1591
01:03:15.750 --> 01:03:17.190
It is really small.

1592
01:03:17.190 --> 01:03:18.490
And we were all in there.

1593
01:03:18.650 --> 01:03:23.250
They tried to put chairs in so that we could sit, but not everyone could sit, obviously.

1594
01:03:23.410 --> 01:03:23.690
Mm-hmm.

1595
01:03:23.970 --> 01:03:25.410
We were pretty crammed in.

1596
01:03:25.550 --> 01:03:27.750
I remember I couldn't look at Phyllis or I would laugh.

1597
01:03:28.090 --> 01:03:28.510
Mm-hmm.

1598
01:03:28.850 --> 01:03:32.630
Whenever she had her exchange with Michael, she would kind of start to break a little.

1599
01:03:32.630 --> 01:03:37.630
And then Rain kicked over that cake with such, like, force.

1600
01:03:37.910 --> 01:03:38.030
Yeah.

1601
01:03:38.130 --> 01:03:39.350
It went flying.

1602
01:03:39.750 --> 01:03:41.430
We all got cake on us.

1603
01:03:41.850 --> 01:03:43.370
And then they would have to clean it up.

1604
01:03:43.490 --> 01:03:46.610
We couldn't do it very many times because we were like, Rain, do you have to kick it

1605
01:03:46.610 --> 01:03:47.330
