You can get neurological issues.

1651
01:05:47.430 --> 01:05:49.790
Most of these pills are a scam.

1652
01:05:50.250 --> 01:05:50.730
Okay.

1653
01:05:50.810 --> 01:05:57.770
They do not really have a tapeworm, but a woman in Iowa swallowed a real one and she got super

1654
